WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
AI work needs an owner. Connect every AI decision to accountable ownership.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Map tool, vendor and workflow.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Name the accountable role.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Attach approval and review dates.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Expose fragmented responsibility.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Ownership must follow every decision.
